<h1>Three boxes with numbers</h1>
<div class="answer">Three orders already sized: moving, marketplace, archive. Plug your size into the calculator.</div>
<h2>Moving 600×400×400, C, T-24</h2>
<p>0201 blank: 2040 × 800 mm. Area 1.63 m², weight ≈ 1.22 kg, BCT ≈ 4460 N. 20 kg of goods → 7 tiers.</p>
<h2>Marketplace 300×200×150, B, T-23</h2>
<p>Self-erecting 0471 or 0201: blank 1030 × 350 mm, 0.36 m², weight 0.23 kg. 3 kg product → 25 tiers, strength is not an issue.</p>
<h2>Archive 0427, 400×300×250</h2>
<p>Lidded box for A4. B, T-22 is enough: documents are light, geometry and 4–5 tiers matter.</p>
